{
  "key": 8290,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, thank goodness that you happened\n",
        "to be there!\r",
        "If it weren’t for you, who knows how\n",
        "far away my BUNEARY could have run...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Baby BUNEARY, back into the Poké\n",
        "Ball you go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m Keira!\n",
        "I’m a Pokémon Contest Judge.\r",
        "Please drop by the Contest Hall\n",
        "so I can thank you properly!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I’m so sorry!\n",
        "Please excuse me.\r",
        "Are you entering a Contest?\n",
        "Tehehe... Enjoy yourself, please!\r",
        "Incidentally, Fantina, the Hearthome\n",
        "Gym Leader, also happens to be\\fa Contest expert.\r",
        "And you may ask yourself, how do\n",
        "I know this? Well, I am Fantina!\r",
        "You may challenge me, but not yet!\n",
        "You must become much stronger.\\fThen, you may challenge me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ta-daah!\n",
        "Kept me waiting again, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Let’s see how much tougher you and\n",
        "I have gotten, right here and now!\r",
        "Hey, you’re a Trainer now. You’re\n",
        "expected to be ready for a battle.\r",
        "No whining! No waiting!\n",
        "Let’s get the show started!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Waaaagh!\n",
        "You KO’d my team again?!\r",
        "This messes up my dream of becoming\n",
        "the greatest Trainer ever...\r",
        "No! I just need to get tougher and\n",
        "keep winning. One day...\r",
        "That’s it! I’m going to challenge\n",
        "the Veilstone Gym next!\r",
        "See you around, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "You’ll be blown away by how much\n",
        "tougher I’ll be next time we meet!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re kidding! They found an Egg at\n",
        "the Day Care in Solaceon Town?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "I hear they found Eggs in the Johto\n",
        "region, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: I’m so glad to see you!\n",
        "You’re not very easy to track down.\r",
        "My grandma told me about what took\n",
        "place in Celestic Town.\r",
        "Thanks for what you did in the ruins!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "But that Team Galactic...\r",
        "I thought they were just an\n",
        "eccentric bunch of freaks...\r",
        "You know, talking about how they’re\n",
        "going to make a new universe and all.\r",
        "And that weird way they dress, too.\n",
        "I thought they were harmless.\r",
        "It appears as if they’re a lot more\n",
        "trouble than I thought...\r",
        "I mean, stealing and hoarding\n",
        "Pokémon... That’s just plain wrong.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way, did you find the ruins\n",
        "interesting at all?\r",
        "If you did, you may want to visit the\n",
        "library in Canalave City.\r",
        "They have some ancient books that\n",
        "you might find interesting.\r",
        "It may also be of help to the\n",
        "completion of your Pokédex.\r",
        "I think you ought to go there.\n",
        "OK, bye-bye for now!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re a Trainer, are you?\r",
        "You’ve got two choices of challenges,\n",
        "either the Gym or a Contest, right?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "I was given the HM Strength at\n",
        "the Lost Tower.\r",
        "The Lost Tower is on Route 209 on\n",
        "the way to Solaceon Town."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00013",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "There are just so many Accessories\n",
        "to dress up Pokémon with.\r",
        "I can’t decide what I should use."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "I get to see Pokémon all day long,\n",
        "but there sure are many kinds.\r",
        "How many are there now?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I used a Water Stone on my Pokémon,\n",
        "and it evolved!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m visiting here all the way from\n",
        "the Hoenn region.\r",
        "I had been hoping to find the Contest\n",
        "Hall, but being new, I lost my way.\r",
        "Fortunately, the local people very\n",
        "kindly led me to my destination.\r",
        "I was impressed by their kindness and\n",
        "generosity to a complete stranger.\r",
        "Now, may I offer you the courtesy\n",
        "of showing you to the Contest Hall?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah.\n",
        "Please follow me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the Contest Hall.\n",
        "Please, do go inside."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "It makes me happy knowing I’ve\n",
        "helped another person."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I do apologize.\n",
        "I should mind my own business."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "When I take my baby out in his stroller,\n",
        "I see the town in a different way.\r",
        "I notice things like stairs and bumps\n",
        "in the sidewalk."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00023",
      "en_US": "Apapapu!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "I went for a stroll in Amity Square\n",
        "with my PACHIRISU today.\r",
        "We came across a Pokémon feather\n",
        "while we walked.\r",
        "Do you think it’d make my PACHIRISU\n",
        "look any cuter?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00025",
      "en_US": "PACHIRISU: Kyukyuuh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, hi.\n",
        "Do you want a Pokémon Egg?\r",
        "They found this at the Day Care in\n",
        "Solaceon Town...\r",
        "Want to take it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00027",
      "en_US": "Here you go!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "This is what I heard about Eggs.\r",
        "If you take that Egg and travel\n",
        "with energetic Pokémon, it’ll hatch.\r",
        "I remember someone announced that...\n",
        "Professor Elm of Johto maybe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold up. You don’t seem to have\n",
        "enough room for the Egg."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "All right, then. I’ll just keep waiting\n",
        "for someone to take care of this Egg.\r",
        "Oh? Wait a minute. If I wait around,\n",
        "will the Egg hatch for me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "They call me Mr. Goods.\r",
        "No one knows my real name.\n",
        "No, not even I do...\r",
        "I dedicate myself to seeking rarities.\n",
        "It’s what I live for.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm!\n",
        "Hmhmhmhm?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00033",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "I was going to give you something,\n",
        "but I just gave a rare thing away.\r",
        "I’ll find something else for you,\n",
        "so just talk to me some other time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00035",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00036",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? Your underground PC appears\n",
        "to be full.\r",
        "I’ll hold your gift until you make\n",
        "room for it. Tell me when, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00038",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll find something rare for you,\n",
        "so talk to me some other time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "Your adventure has gone global in\n",
        "scale, has it?\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00041",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve conquered all the Gyms,\n",
        "have you?\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00042",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve finally conquered the Master\n",
        "Rank of the Cute Contest!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00043",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve finally conquered the Master\n",
        "Rank of the Cool Contest!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve finally conquered the Master\n",
        "Rank of the Beauty Contest!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00045",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve finally conquered the Master\n",
        "Rank of the Tough Contest!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve finally conquered the Master\n",
        "Rank of the Smart Contest!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve met so very many people\n",
        "in the underground tunnels!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve given away many items to\n",
        "people while underground!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve dug up so many Fossils in\n",
        "the underground tunnels!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve set many Traps in the\n",
        "underground tunnels!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve finally beaten 10 Trainers in\n",
        "a row at the Battle Tower!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How impressive!\r",
        "You’ve finally beaten 50 Trainers in\n",
        "a row at the Battle Tower!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh!\n",
        "How incredible!\r",
        "You’ve finally beaten 100 Trainers in\n",
        "a row at the Battle Tower!\r",
        "For a Trainer like you, I have just\n",
        "the thing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "I can feel the baby stroller getting\n",
        "heavier each and every day.\r",
        "I wonder what kind of Pokémon my\n",
        "child will become friends with first?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00055",
      "en_US": "Papa! Mama!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "I lived in total seclusion up in\n",
        "the mountains for thirty years!\r",
        "I’m going to clean up some Contests\n",
        "with a dance move I came up with!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0977_C05_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "I’d like to live in Hearthome when\n",
        "I get married.\r",
        "But my boyfriend wants to live in\n",
        "Veilstone ’cause of its Game Corner..."
      ]
    },
    {
